{
  "answer": "**日本**。\n\n1970 年，Richard Serra 获得古根海姆奖学金后前往日本，参加第 10 届东京双年展（Tokyo Biennale，“Between Man and Matter”）。他在东京上野公园创作并安装了《To Encircle Base Plate (Hexagram)》和《Sugi Tree》，这两件作品是他的第一组户外雕塑。\n\n来源：\n- https://forward.fergusmccaffrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/SerraDrawings_McCaffrey_Final_pages.pdf\n- https://browse.library.kiwix.org/content/wikipedia_en_all_maxi/A/Richard_Serra\n- https://www.praemiumimperiale.org/laureate/serra/",
